UnitQuartermaster::constructor
└── when deployed
    ├── it exposes HATS CREW_HAT_ID CAPTAIN_HAT_ID CREW_CHANGE_DELAY MUTINY_MODULE
    └── it sets mutiny active false


UnitQuartermaster::requestAddCrew
├── when captain requests add for a valid candidate
│   ├── it schedules pending executable at now plus delay
│   ├── when executeAddCrew is called before delay elapses
│   │   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_NotExecutable
│   └── when delay elapses
│       ├── it calls Hats mintHat for the candidate
│       └── it clears pending crew add
├── when caller is not captain
│   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_OnlyCaptain
├── when mutiny is active
│   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_MutinyActive
├── when candidate is the captain
│   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_InvalidCandidate
└── when candidate already wears crew
    └── it reverts with Quartermaster_InvalidCandidate


UnitQuartermaster::requestRemoveCrew
├── when captain requests remove for crew member
│   ├── it schedules pending remove
│   ├── when executeRemoveCrew is called before delay elapses
│   │   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_NotExecutable
│   └── when delay elapses
│       ├── it calls Hats setHatWearerStatus to revoke crew
│       └── it clears pending crew remove
└── when mutiny is active
    └── it reverts with Quartermaster_MutinyActive


UnitQuartermaster::executeAddCrew
└── when there is no pending add
    └── it reverts with Quartermaster_NoPendingOperation


UnitQuartermaster::mintCrewFromMutiny
├── when caller is not mutiny module
│   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_OnlyMutinyModule
├── when caller is mutiny module and recipient is valid
│   └── it calls Hats mintHat for recipient
├── when recipient is captain
│   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_InvalidCandidate
└── when crew hat is at max supply
    └── it reverts with Quartermaster_CrewHatMaxSupply


UnitQuartermaster::setMutinyActive
├── when caller is not mutiny module
│   └── it reverts with Quartermaster_OnlyMutinyModule
└── when caller is mutiny module
    └── it sets mutiny active true


UnitQuartermaster::crewHandoffForMutiny
├── when new captain already has crew
│   └── it calls Hats transferHat from new captain to former
└── when new captain has no crew
    └── it calls Hats mintHat for former captain
